/**
  \defgroup org_mitk_gui_qt_restapi org.mitk.gui.qt.restapi
  \ingroup MITKPlugins

  \brief Plugin for monitoring and controlling the MITK REST API server.

  This plugin provides a view for managing the REST API server that enables external applications
